extends layout

block content
  h1 Import P&N statements
  p Upload one or more OFX exports. Review the accounts before importing into Actual. Start with the oldest history you want to keep, and include both sides of transfers when possible.
  .alert.alert-info
    | Loans usually belong off-budget. Check the closing balance: money owed should be negative. Transfers between on-budget and off-budget accounts need a category.
  form#ofx-upload
    label.form-label(for='ofx-files') OFX files (up to 10 files, 5 MB each; 8 MB total)
    input#ofx-files.form-control(type='file' accept='.ofx,.qfx' multiple required)
    button.btn.btn-primary.mt-3(type='submit') Preview files
  #ofx-status.mt-3(role='status' aria-live='polite')
  form#ofx-confirm.mt-4(hidden)
    #ofx-accounts
    p Matching uses shared P&N references. For Up transfers, choose any linked Up account or limit matching to one account. Only unique matches with a bank-identifying description are linked automatically; others remain for review. Existing linked transfers are reused. Future Up syncs also check for matches.
    p Existing accounts keep their opening balance and budget status. New accounts get an opening balance calculated from the statement. Overlapping files are de-duplicated.
    button#ofx-import.btn.btn-success(type='submit') Create accounts and import
  #ofx-result.mt-4

block scripts
  script(src='/ofx.js')
